      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但樱花桂冠跑步时用脚垂直踏向地面，\n仿佛飞舞在空中。对她来说……",
      "source_fingerprint": "191d6b54900559d087c0971b8a0e320641d15bc8dec1f76a4665934267db1f98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
